WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,830
It's a complete insult

2
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:08,030
I even lowered my posture and begged him.

3
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:09,950
I even took photos like that

4
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:11,430
How dare he laugh at me

5
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:13,150
We're living like hell right now

6
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:14,310
cold and hungry

7
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:16,510
He lives in a house like heaven

8
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:18,430
That's our only hope

9
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:19,710
Since it's too soft

10
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:20,910
Then come hard

11
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:22,350
It's really not possible

12
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:24,030
We rushed directly to his house

13
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:26,830
I don’t want to endure the pain of cancer, hunger and pain anymore.

14
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:28,350
As long as I can live in his house

15
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:29,790
It doesn't matter what you do

16
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:31,270
Zhang Yi is too selfish and vicious

17
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:33,550
Watching us suffer from cancer and hunger

18
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:35,030
They refuse to help us even if they live or die.

19
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:36,470
We can't sit back and avoid

20
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:37,870
Such a nice house

21
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:39,110
Not worthy of him at all

22
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:45,200
So he has the warmth and food all to himself

23
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,480
He should be kicked out

24
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:49,560
It’s just us outside

25
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:52,320
I deserve to live in that stable and warm house
